@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Ingest External Data
top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8C6
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 12
}

note top
Steps:
1) Choose source type
2) Enter URL/API + credentials
3) Authenticate + fetch content
4) If fetch fails, show error (auth/network/format)
5) Validate + de-duplicate
6) Store DataAsset(s) + metadata
7) Index assets + confirm success
end note

(*) --> "1. Choose source type"
--> "2. Enter URL/API\n+ credentials"
--> "3. Authenticate\n+ fetch content"

if (Fetch ok?) then (Yes)
  --> "5. Validate\n+ de-duplicate"
  --> "6. Store DataAsset(s)\n+ metadata"
  --> "7. Index assets\n+ confirm success"
else
  --> "4. Show error\n(auth/network/format)"
endif

--> (*)

@enduml